  "body": "### Summary\nLOT-032 (#59, PR #262) needs a captured page with this state to test quote analysis on real HTML. Hand-built snippets cannot stand in for it (LESSONS 36).\n\nState: a quote whose author account is deleted or unknown, where the header may not read '<pseudo> a écrit :' (audit C quirk 14).\n\nSource: docs/lots/LOT-032-quote-analysis.md, pending capture.\n\nAcceptance criteria\n- A real page with this state, anonymized, in captures/ with a MANIFEST row.\n- The legacy oracle run on it, if it is a topic page.\n- A test in LOT-032's suite reads it.",
